  "historyNote": "#5911, eff 10-14-94; ss by #7410, eff 11-23-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16; amd by #12496, eff 3-21-18",
